OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as caravan filled with
OL,4,Arubbish dumped by A52
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials said it was filled with
OL,7,Fhousehold waste items and asked drivers
OL,8,Fwho may have been passing when it was
OL,9,Fdumped to help with their
OL,10,Finvestigation.
